==== stdout ====
Usage: raphael favorite <path> [options]
       raphael favorite --id <id> [options]

Add an area or project to favorites.

Already a favorite succeeds. Favorites keep their state while archived, but archived items are omitted from the favorites list.

Options:
      --id <id>
      Address by durable id instead of path.
      --json
      Print one JSON result.
  -h, --help
      Show this help.

Examples:
  raphael favorite /work
  raphael favorite --id 42
  raphael favorite /work/raphael --json

Prints:
  The id and favorite state. JSON carries `nodeId` and `isFavorite`.

Next: raphael favorites

See also: raphael help unfavorite
